        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>RFC 9132 — DOTS Signal Channel Protocol</title>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] } };\n  </script>\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    html, body {\n      margin: 0;\n      background: white;\n      color: #202020;\n      font-family: \"Times New Roman\", Times, serif;\n    }\n    .page {\n      position: relative;\n      width: 1654px;\n      height: 2353px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      background: #fff;\n      overflow: hidden;\n    }\n    .header {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 98px;\n      left: 156px;\n      right: 156px;\n      height: 61px;\n      border-bottom: 2px solid #cccccc;\n      font-size: 28px;\n      line-height: 40px;\n    }\n    .header .left { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; }\n    .header .center { position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; top: 0; text-align: center; }\n    .header .right { position: absolute; right: 0; top: 0; }\n    .content {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 183px;\n      top: 195px;\n      width: 1288px;\n      font-size: 31px;\n      line-height: 1.22;\n    }\n    .continued {\n      margin-left: 56px;\n      padding: 0 48px 19px 56px;\n      border-left: 2px solid #dedede;\n      width: 1172px;\n    }\n    p {\n      margin: 0 0 29px 0;\n    }\n    .link { color: #0000b8; }\n    .continued p { margin: 0; }\n    .first-paragraph { margin-top: 27px; }\n    .session { margin-top: 28px; margin-bottom: 29px; }\n    .codebox {\n      width: 1287px;\n      height: 352px;\n      margin-top: 0;\n      margin-bottom: 27px;\n      padding: 28px 57px;\n      border: 2px solid #ededed;\n      background: #fafafa;\n      font-family: \"Courier New\", Courier, monospace;\n      font-size: 27px;\n      line-height: 1.09;\n      white-space: pre;\n    }\n    .caption {\n      font-style: italic;\n      margin-bottom: 30px;\n    }\n    .additional {\n      margin-bottom: 59px;\n    }\n    .definition {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 83px 1fr;\n      column-gap: 0;\n      align-items: start;\n      margin-top: 0;\n    }\n    .term {\n      padding-top: 0;\n    }\n    .description {\n      padding-left: 0;\n      max-width: 1195px;\n    }\n    .description p {\n      margin-bottom: 30px;\n    }\n    .footer {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 156px;\n      right: 156px;\n      bottom: 96px;\n      height: 66px;\n      border-top: 2px solid #c7c7c7;\n      font-size: 28px;\n      line-height: 61px;\n    }\n    .footer .left { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; }\n    .footer .center { position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; top: 0; text-align: center; }\n    .footer .right { position: absolute; right: 0; top: 0; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"page\">\n    <header class=\"header\">\n      <span class=\"left\">RFC 9132</span>\n      <span class=\"center\">DOTS Signal Channel Protocol</span>\n      <span class=\"right\">September 2021</span>\n    </header>\n\n    <main class=\"content\">\n      <div class=\"continued\">\n        <p>encrypted DOTS heartbeat request\"/'heartbeat- interval') or ((\"size of encrypted<br>DOTS heartbeat request\" + \"average size of an encrypted mitigation<br>request\")/'heartbeat- interval'). Absent any explicit configuration or inability to<br>dynamically adjust 'probing-rate' values (<span class=\"link\">Section 4.8.1</span> of [<span class=\"link\">RFC7252</span>]), DOTS agents<br>use 5 bytes/second as a default 'probing-rate' value.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <p class=\"first-paragraph\">If the DOTS agent wishes to change the default values of message transmission parameters, it<br><strong>SHOULD</strong> follow the guidance given in <span class=\"link\">Section 4.8.1</span> of [<span class=\"link\">RFC7252</span>]. The DOTS agents <strong>MUST</strong> use the<br>negotiated values for message transmission parameters and default values for non-negotiated<br>message transmission parameters.</p>\n\n      <p class=\"session\">The signal channel session configuration is applicable to a single DOTS signal channel session<br>between DOTS agents, so the 'cuid' Uri-Path <strong>MUST NOT</strong> be used.</p>\n\n      <div class=\"codebox\">Header: PUT (Code=0.03)\nUri-Path: \".well-known\"\nUri-Path: \"dots\"\nUri-Path: \"config\"\nUri-Path: \"sid=123\"\nContent-Format: \"application/dots+cbor\"\n\n{\n ...\n}</div>\n\n      <p class=\"caption\">Figure 21: PUT to Convey the DOTS Signal Channel Session Configuration Data</p>\n\n      <p class=\"additional\">The additional Uri-Path parameter to those defined in <span class=\"link\">Table 1</span> is as follows:</p>\n\n      <div class=\"definition\">\n        <div class=\"term\">sid:</div>\n        <div class=\"description\">\n          <p>Session Identifier is an identifier for the DOTS signal channel session configuration data<br>represented as an integer. This identifier <strong>MUST</strong> be generated by DOTS clients. 'sid' values<br><strong>MUST</strong> increase monotonically (when a new PUT is generated by a DOTS client to convey the<br>configuration parameters for the signal channel).</p>\n          <p>This is a mandatory attribute.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <footer class=\"footer\">\n      <span class=\"left\">Boucadair, et al.</span>\n      <span class=\"center\">Standards Track</span>\n      <span class=\"right\">Page 46</span>\n    </footer>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
